---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="找不到頁面｜Mejia 美家">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;padding:40px 0">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">404 · Page Not Found</div>
      <h2>這一頁找不到了</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline:auto">網址可能已經更換。你可以回到首頁，或直接留下聯絡方式讓顧問協助你。</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">回到首頁 <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-line">預約諮詢</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
